  "qfq panel neutralises the mechanical ex-date dividend drop; only the economic move net of dividend is measured",
  "yield proxy (cash_div_per_10 / 10 / qfq close) overstates yield for older events because qfq back-adjusts prices; quintiles are relative buckets only",
